    "helpDocumentCount": 1,
    "cliParsedDescription": "codegen is READ-ONLY against the target database: it introspects schema metadata and writes\na generated file to the output directory. It never creates, alters, or executes anything in\nthe target database, and never modifies files in any other project. What you do with the\ngenerated output is entirely up to you."
  },
